@startuml sequence-uc07
title 图 2-7 UC-07 接诊与拒诊 · 顺序图

skinparam {
  DefaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
  DefaultFontSize 11
  shadowing false
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  BorderColor #94A3B8
}

actor 医生 as P
participant "DoctorOrderPage" as UI
participant "ConsultationOrderController" as CTRL
participant "ConsultationOrderAppService" as SVC
participant "ConsultationOrder" as ORDER
participant "ConsultationOrderRepository" as REPO
participant "RefundGateway" as REFUND
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "AuditRecorder" as AUDIT

P -> UI : 打开「待接诊」订单
UI -> CTRL : POST /api/v1/orders/{id}/accept\n（或 /reject，body 含 reason）
CTRL -> SVC : accept/reject(orderId, currentDoctorId, reason)
SVC -> REPO : findByIdAndDoctorId(orderId, doctorId)
REPO --> SVC : ORDER

alt 订单不存在或不属于当前医生
  SVC --> CTRL : 404 NOT_FOUND
  CTRL --> UI : 统一错误响应
else 订单状态不是「待接诊」
  SVC --> CTRL : 409 STATE_CONFLICT
  CTRL --> UI : 返回 currentStatus
else 接诊
  SVC -> ORDER : accept(now)
  SVC -> REPO : update(order)，version + 1
  REPO -> DB : UPDATE order SET status='IN_CONSULTATION',\naccepted_at=?, version=?+1 WHERE id=? AND status='PENDING_ACCEPT'
  SVC -> AUDIT : record(ORDER_ACCEPT, orderId)
  SVC --> CTRL : OrderVO(status=IN_CONSULTATION)
  CTRL --> UI : 200 { data }
else 拒诊
  SVC -> ORDER : reject(reason, now)
  SVC -> REFUND : refund(orderNo, fee)
  REFUND --> SVC : refundResult
  SVC -> REPO : update(order)，version + 1
  REPO -> DB : UPDATE order SET status='CANCELLED', cancelled_at=?,\nreject_reason=?, cancel_reason='REJECTED', version=?+1
  SVC -> AUDIT : record(ORDER_REJECT, reason)
  SVC --> CTRL : OrderVO(status=CANCELLED)
  CTRL --> UI : 200 { data }
end

note right of SVC
  拒诊理由为空时返回 400；
  退款为教学模拟，不接真实支付通道，
  只记录退款结果与审计日志。
end note
@enduml
